---
import {release,releaseView} from '../lib/release';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import {person} from '../data/site';import {href,contact} from '../lib/paths';
---
<Base title="About RBE WaveLab" description="RBE WaveLab is a proprietary freeware virtual laboratory by Ahmed Rabie, created to support transmission-line engineering education and guided scientific interpretation." path="about/" schema={person}><div class="container narrow"><header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">About the project</span><h1>Make engineering<br/>behavior understandable.</h1><p class="lede">RBE WaveLab connects a physical question, a supported analytical model and the instruments used to interpret its result.</p></header><article class="article-body section"><h2>Built around learning</h2><p>The initial focus is transmission-line and communication-engineering education: propagation, reflections, standing waves, losses and distortionless conditions. Guided experiments support a deliberate cycle of prediction, configuration, measurement and interpretation.</p><p>WaveLab is a desktop virtual laboratory, not a replacement for every physical instrument or a certification of engineering outcomes. Its useful boundaries are explicit in the <a href={href('scientific-scope/')}>scientific scope</a>.</p><h2>Ownership and access</h2><p>The copyright holder and licensor is <strong>Ahmed Rabie</strong>, an individual. <strong>RBE</strong> is the display brand. It is not represented as a registered company.</p><p>All V1.x releases and updates are free under the <a href={href('license/')}>approved proprietary-freeware terms</a>, including commercial and institutional use. The application source remains private. Future V2 pricing and licensing are undecided.</p><h2>Where the project stands</h2><p>{releaseView(release).label}. {release.notice} See the <a href={href('download/')}>verified distribution state</a> and authoritative release notes for current qualifications.</p><p><a href={contact}>General contact and collaboration →</a></p></article></div></Base>
